"Keepsake.dc.html", "Notifications.dc.html", "OnboardingWeather.dc.html"], "notes": {"tIdentity": {"x": 0, "y": 20, "text": "Identity", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 5780}, "tArrival": {"x": 0, "y": 1224, "text": "Arrival & setup", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 6970}, "nLaunch": {"x": -500, "y": 1504, "w": 420, "fill": "orange", "size": "m", "text": "Launch animation (shown slowed down here as a 7 s loop)\n\nIn the app it runs once on a cold start and takes about 2.2 seconds; a tap skips it.\n\n1. Still launch screen (iOS shows it instantly): night sky, stars, crescent moon, the sun asleep and half under the night sea. No text.\n2. Sunrise, 0 to 1.1 s: the sky warms from night to dawn, the stars fade, the dunes light up, the sun rises and its rays unfold.\n3. Good morning, 1.1 to 1.4 s: the sun opens its eyes for a moment.\n4. Settle, 1.4 to 2.2 s: the sun glides and shrinks into its place on Today's arc while Home fades in underneath.\n\nReduce Motion: a 0.3 s cross-fade from the night frame to Home. Returning from the background: no animation."}, "nYearPhotos": {"x": 5510, "y": 4192, "w": 420, "fill": "orange", "size": "m", "text": "Photos card: which six photos\n\nThe card favours the photos you keep coming back to.\n\n1. Each photo quietly counts how often it was opened in the photo viewer (at least 1 second on screen; scrolling past a thumbnail doesn't count). Opening it again within the same hour counts once.\n2. The card picks the six most returned-to photos of the year. Ties go to the more recent one.\n3. If fewer than six have been opened, the rest are filled with the most recent photos.\n4. Long-press a tile in the preview to swap it; a photo you swap in stays for that year.\n\nThe count is a small number stored with the session, and synced with iCloud only when sync is on. It's never shown anywhere, and deleting the photo deletes it too."}, "tHome": {"x": 0, "y": 2428, "text": "Home & sessions", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 7320}, "tHistory": {"x": 0, "y": 3632, "text": "History & your year", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 12960}, "tSheets": {"x": 0, "y": 4836, "text": "Sheets, settings & support", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 5090}, "tBeyond": {"x": 0, "y": 6040, "text": "Beyond the phone", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 5804}, "tLarge": {"x": 0, "y": 7324, "text": "iPad & Mac", "kind": "title1", "maxW": 2454}, "nSetup": {"x": 5640, "y": 1708, "w": 420, "fill": "orange", "size": "m", "text": "Setup is 5 steps (update 53)\n\n1 Your game · 2 When did you start? · 3 Before today · 4 From today on · 5 Keep your game safe.\n\nThe setup scene sits at the top of steps 2–4: the sun rises with your starting score and the chips fill in (craft, start year, hours, pace), ending with the finish-line date on step 4.\n\nStarting this year shows \"hours so far\" as a total instead of hours a week.\n\nNo permissions in setup: notifications are asked on the first session, weather a week later."}}}